WEBVTT

00:18:58.906 --> 00:19:01.308
are suffering and dying.

00:19:01.308 --> 00:19:04.020
And if this continues,

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.814
we are unlikely to be able to stop the climate changing,

00:19:07.814 --> 00:19:12.861
even after we have eliminated the use of fossil fuels.

00:19:12.861 --> 00:19:17.097
I believe I've shown you how we can work with nature

00:19:17.097 --> 00:19:19.553
at very low cost

00:19:19.553 --> 00:19:22.049
to reverse all this.

00:19:22.049 --> 00:19:24.481
We are already doing so

00:19:24.481 --> 00:19:28.477
on about 15 million hectares

00:19:28.477 --> 00:19:31.109
on five continents,